# Ignore the local environments and the downloaded model pack. Both are large,
# reproducible from pyproject.toml, and the model in particular is a few hundred
# MB that does not belong in git.
face-service/.venv/
face-service/.venv-dml/
face-service/models/
face-service/identities/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# InsightFace model packs, downloaded at runtime by insightface itself.
# buffalo_s unpacks to ~158 MB and the .zip is kept alongside it, so ~280 MB
# total. Vendoring them would put hundreds of megabytes of third-party weights
# in the repository, and they carry their own licence - see the Licence section
# of README.md.
models/

